WEBVTT

00:16.040 --> 00:19.650
<b>Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa</b>

00:19.650 --> 00:23.290
<b>Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru</b>

00:23.290 --> 00:27.280
<b>Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete</b>

00:30.630 --> 00:34.200
<b>Hashiri-tsuzukeru kimi no tsuyosa ga</b>

00:34.200 --> 00:37.830
<b>Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku</b>

00:37.830 --> 00:41.830
<b>Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase</b>

00:45.170 --> 00:52.410
<b>Tatoe hitori de mo kimi
no koto shinjite itai</b>

00:52.410 --> 00:59.690
<b>Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu</b>

00:59.690 --> 01:03.360
<b>Nani o mitsukete yukou</b>

01:03.360 --> 01:06.960
<b>Kokoro o hakidashite</b>

01:06.960 --> 01:14.240
<b>Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara</b>

01:14.240 --> 01:17.870
<b>Nani o mitsumete iyou</b>

01:17.870 --> 01:24.610
<b>Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o</b>

01:24.610 --> 01:28.380
<b>Let it go, shinjiyou</b>

01:31.090 --> 01:33.450
<b>So, it's been three months
since we left Chang'an?</b>

01:34.620 --> 01:37.030
<b>It seems we still have
a long way to go.</b>

01:37.030 --> 01:38.630
<b>We still don't have any details</b>

01:38.630 --> 01:41.500
<b>about the experiments
to revive Gyumaoh.</b>

01:41.500 --> 01:44.130
<b>We have no time for fool's errands.</b>

01:44.130 --> 01:49.140
<b>But I don't think any part of this
journey has been wasted.</b>

01:49.140 --> 01:50.170
<b>Well...</b>

01:50.170 --> 01:51.870
<b>Hey, Sanzo, Hakkai.</b>

01:52.970 --> 01:54.440
<b>Take a look.</b>

01:55.640 --> 01:59.380
<b>Wow! It looks tasty!</b>

01:59.380 --> 02:01.950
<b>So, that's all you ever say.</b>

02:01.950 --> 02:05.850
<b>You know, we're always traveling
towards the setting sun, right?</b>

02:07.090 --> 02:08.560
<b>Ah, youth!</b>

02:10.960 --> 02:13.730
<b>Stop that! That was super cheesy!</b>

02:13.730 --> 02:15.560
<b>Was it really that bad?</b>

02:17.730 --> 02:19.790
<b>Nothing's been wasted?</b>

02:21.070 --> 02:22.640
<b>Come on, let's go!</b>

02:22.640 --> 02:22.870
<b>Yes, let's.</b>

02:22.870 --> 02:24.340
<b>In we go.
Yes, let's.</b>

02:26.310 --> 02:30.540
<b>We'll get to see that over and over
as long as we're alive.</b>

02:31.550 --> 02:33.100
<b>As long as you're alive?</b>

02:34.120 --> 02:35.980
<b>Then what about you?</b>

02:36.650 --> 02:39.150
<b>You have breath, and
you have warmth,</b>

02:39.150 --> 02:42.390
<b>but without the driving force
of emotion,</b>

02:42.390 --> 02:44.150
<b>you're no different than a corpse.</b>

02:45.290 --> 02:48.900
<b>How long do you intend
to wait, Nataku?</b>

02:48.900 --> 02:52.900
<b>That brat's memories are all sealed
away in the Heavens.</b>

02:52.900 --> 02:55.970
<b>He remembers nothing of the crime he
committed five hundred years ago,</b>

02:55.970 --> 02:57.570
<b>or you or me,</b>

02:57.570 --> 02:59.880
<b>or Tenpou or Kenren.</b>

02:59.880 --> 03:02.470
<b>Not to mention Konzen.</b>

03:03.680 --> 03:07.480
<b>It's the cruel fate you desired.</b>

03:07.480 --> 03:10.250
<b>And even so, you intend
to continue waiting?</b>

03:10.250 --> 03:13.220
<b>Even after turning into an
empty shell like a doll,</b>

03:13.220 --> 03:16.290
<b>your soul is still alone,</b>

03:16.290 --> 03:19.560
<b>wandering in a time five
hundred years past.</b>

03:33.680 --> 03:35.180
<b>There's nothing to do!</b>

03:35.180 --> 03:37.380
<b>Now that you mention it, there's
been a noticeable drop</b>

03:37.380 --> 03:39.780
<b>in both demons and assassins,
hasn't there?</b>

03:39.780 --> 03:42.880
<b>Right? I'm getting totally out of shape!</b>

03:42.880 --> 03:44.950
<b>Sheesh, don't you have anything
else on your mind</b>

03:44.950 --> 03:47.190
<b>besides eating and fighting,
you monkey head?!</b>

03:47.190 --> 03:47.460
<b>Shut up!</b>

03:47.460 --> 03:50.460
<b>What a low-level conversation.
Those idiots!</b>

03:50.460 --> 03:50.630
<b>You pervy water sprite!</b>

03:50.630 --> 03:53.620
<b>It can't be helped. They're just bored.</b>

03:55.300 --> 03:56.200
<b>What the?!</b>

03:56.200 --> 03:57.900
<b>Why'd you stop so suddenly?</b>

03:57.900 --> 03:59.940
<b>Everyone, please rejoice.</b>

03:59.940 --> 04:02.800
<b>It looks like we have a solution
for your lack of exercise.</b>

04:06.340 --> 04:08.940
<b>Priest Sanzo and company, I presume?</b>

04:08.940 --> 04:10.650
<b>So what if we are?</b>

04:10.650 --> 04:12.150
<b>We're the Armored Demon Corps</b>

04:12.150 --> 04:14.380
<b>under the direct command
of Lord Kougaiji.</b>

04:14.380 --> 04:15.880
<b>My name's Rashu.</b>

04:15.880 --> 04:17.350
<b>State your business.</b>

04:18.120 --> 04:22.690
<b>By the orders of my Lord, I shall put
you to the sword, here and now.</b>

04:22.690 --> 04:24.460
<b>Prepare yourselves.</b>

04:24.460 --> 04:25.930
<b>Attack!</b>

04:28.760 --> 04:30.230
<b>What's the meaning of this?!</b>

04:31.200 --> 04:33.840
<b>Why did you send the Armored Demon
Corps against Sanzo's group</b>

04:33.840 --> 04:35.270
<b>without even consulting me?!</b>

04:36.000 --> 04:37.510
<b>Wasn't it just the other day</b>

04:37.510 --> 04:41.080
<b>you beat a hasty retreat
away from those boys?</b>

04:41.080 --> 04:43.440
<b>Do you think you're in any position
to demand explanations?</b>

04:45.050 --> 04:47.640
<b>Are your wounds from that
encounter healed?</b>

04:49.180 --> 04:52.490
<b>But this is like sending them
to their deaths for nothing!</b>

04:52.490 --> 04:54.490
<b>Not entirely.</b>

04:54.490 --> 04:58.390
<b>Don't you think it's far better
than living for nothing?</b>

04:58.390 --> 04:59.990
<b>Take a look, Kougaiji.</b>

05:00.560 --> 05:02.830
<b>The experiments to revive him</b>

05:02.830 --> 05:05.230
<b>have finally entered another new stage.</b>

05:05.800 --> 05:09.830
<b>Now that she mentions it, there's more
equipment here than before.</b>

05:10.870 --> 05:12.370
<b>But...</b>

05:12.370 --> 05:16.750
<b>It's such a horrifying sight, no matter
how many times I see it.</b>

05:16.750 --> 05:19.680
<b>So, I've decided to have you
concentrate all your resources</b>

05:19.680 --> 05:21.620
<b>solely on searching
for the Scriptures</b>

05:21.620 --> 05:23.980
<b>which you'd been doing on
the side up until now.</b>

05:24.890 --> 05:30.360
<b>In other words, I'm taking you
off the Genjo Sanzo case.</b>

05:30.360 --> 05:31.460
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

05:31.460 --> 05:33.430
<b>You haven't forgotten, have you?</b>

05:33.430 --> 05:36.500
<b>That he can't be revived unless
we collect all five</b>

05:36.500 --> 05:40.370
<b>of the Founding Scriptures
of Heaven and Earth</b>

05:40.370 --> 05:43.000
<b>that were said to have been used by
the gods when the world was created.</b>

05:43.870 --> 05:47.580
<b>The Seiten Scripture that Koumyou
Sanzo used to guard</b>

05:47.580 --> 05:51.450
<b>governs the light of hope
that is evolution.</b>

05:51.450 --> 05:54.420
<b>The Maten Scripture that
Genjo Sanzo has</b>

05:54.420 --> 05:56.890
<b>can consign all power to oblivion.</b>

05:56.890 --> 06:00.340
<b>And the other three scriptures
which exist separately.</b>

06:01.460 --> 06:04.250
<b>Gather them as soon
as possible for me.</b>

06:05.390 --> 06:09.130
<b>What? Displeased? I was actually
hoping you'd be grateful.</b>

06:09.130 --> 06:10.770
<b>Grateful?!</b>

06:10.770 --> 06:13.800
<b>Because it means you'll be able
to free Rasetsunyo</b>

06:13.800 --> 06:16.340
<b>from the binding spell that
much sooner, right?</b>

06:16.340 --> 06:18.670
<b>Though, of course, it'll depend
on how hard you work at it.</b>

06:18.670 --> 06:20.410
<b>You'd better be telling the truth.</b>

06:20.410 --> 06:22.010
<b>Oh, who knows about that?</b>

06:22.010 --> 06:25.450
<b>You can say such things to me WHEN
you've accomplished your mission.</b>

06:26.610 --> 06:28.080
<b>Hurry now.</b>

06:28.850 --> 06:31.190
<b>Oh, that reminds me.</b>

06:31.190 --> 06:35.020
<b>Please don't let Lirin out
of the castle too much.</b>

06:35.020 --> 06:39.320
<b>She's our precious only
daughter, after all.</b>

06:41.500 --> 06:45.160
<b>Yes, very precious. Isn't that right?</b>

06:46.200 --> 06:48.900
<b>We've been removed from the mission
to get rid of Sanzo's group?!</b>

06:48.900 --> 06:50.630
<b>Hey, now, is this for real?</b>

06:52.770 --> 06:54.880
<b>The mission that's been assigned to us</b>

06:54.880 --> 06:59.350
<b>is to locate Sanzos other than Genjo
and take their scriptures.</b>

06:59.350 --> 07:01.650
<b>I was told to concentrate
our efforts on that task.</b>

07:02.750 --> 07:04.620
<b>No matter what the task,
it can't be helped</b>

07:04.620 --> 07:08.790
<b>if that's the shortest route to ending
this idiotic experiment.</b>

07:08.790 --> 07:10.390
<b>And is that how we're going to end up</b>

07:10.390 --> 07:14.100
<b>doing exactly as that she-fox
says again, Kou?</b>

07:14.100 --> 07:15.630
<b>Don't get me wrong.</b>

07:15.630 --> 07:18.400
<b>If we entrust this task
to someone else,</b>

07:18.400 --> 07:21.240
<b>there's sure to be more wanton
destruction of life.</b>

07:21.240 --> 07:22.400
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

07:22.400 --> 07:23.940
<b>Yaone!</b>

07:23.940 --> 07:25.940
<b>You'll remain here with Lirin.</b>

07:25.940 --> 07:27.880
<b>With Lady Lirin?</b>

07:27.880 --> 07:29.840
<b>I have a bad feeling.</b>

07:29.840 --> 07:33.680
<b>Stay by her side at all times for me.</b>

07:33.680 --> 07:35.380
<b>Yes, my Lord.</b>

07:35.380 --> 07:39.890
<b>Kou, are you really giving up on
going after Sanzo's group?</b>

07:39.890 --> 07:41.390
<b>In appearance, yeah.</b>

07:41.390 --> 07:44.720
<b>Do you think they'll be
killed so easily?</b>

07:45.560 --> 07:48.630
<b>No, I can't allow them to be
killed by others.</b>

07:48.630 --> 07:50.890
<b>I have a whole lot of
payback to dole out.</b>

07:52.830 --> 07:56.070
<b>Someday, without fail,</b>

07:56.070 --> 07:58.140
<b>WE will defeat Sanzo's group.</b>

07:58.140 --> 07:59.610
<b>Here goes!</b>

08:04.080 --> 08:05.600
<b>Easy win, easy win!</b>

08:08.020 --> 08:12.550
<b>Goodness, I guess when
your specialty is eating,</b>

08:12.550 --> 08:14.040
<b>your energy is off the charts!</b>

08:19.490 --> 08:21.300
<b>Oh, pardon my late introduction,</b>

08:21.300 --> 08:24.070
<b>but my specialty is frying.</b>

08:24.070 --> 08:26.860
<b>Your personality sure has taken
a turn for the better!</b>

08:33.310 --> 08:34.980
<b>So Sanzo's gun is the only thing</b>

08:34.980 --> 08:36.570
<b>that can make them disappear,
armor and all.</b>

08:44.020 --> 08:45.490
<b>That's the last of them!</b>

08:47.820 --> 08:50.450
<b>I had heard the stories,
but I never expected this!</b>

08:51.060 --> 08:52.530
<b>What will you do, Mr. Rashu?</b>

08:53.130 --> 08:56.630
<b>I should think it'd be better
if you withdrew for the day.</b>

08:56.630 --> 08:58.100
<b>I have no need...</b>

08:58.870 --> 09:00.330
<b>...of mercy!</b>

09:02.640 --> 09:04.230
<b>Sanzo!</b>

09:08.240 --> 09:10.480
<b>You okay, Sanzo?!</b>

09:10.480 --> 09:12.470
<b>That was unnecessary!</b>

09:15.880 --> 09:18.490
<b>Is it okay to leave everything like this?</b>

09:18.490 --> 09:21.590
<b>Is today the day they pick up
the unburnable trash?</b>

09:21.590 --> 09:23.090
<b>Leave them.</b>

09:23.090 --> 09:25.830
<b>I'm sure some idiot will pick them up.</b>

09:25.830 --> 09:28.230
<b>Sanzo, if we sell this,</b>

09:28.230 --> 09:30.870
<b>you think we can at least buy a
green pepper and meat lunch?</b>

09:30.870 --> 09:32.530
<b>Don't pick it up!</b>

09:32.530 --> 09:34.020
<b>Hey, hey, do I look cool?</b>

09:35.840 --> 09:37.300
<b>Cheapskate.</b>

09:47.780 --> 09:48.650
<b>What the hell?!</b>

09:48.650 --> 09:49.420
<b>Goku!
What the hell?!</b>

09:49.420 --> 09:50.150
<b>Goku!
That idiot!</b>

09:50.150 --> 09:51.020
<b>That idiot!</b>

09:51.020 --> 09:52.750
<b>Sanzo!</b>

09:52.750 --> 09:54.190
<b>Goku!</b>

09:57.630 --> 09:59.930
<b>I have you now, Sanzo!</b>

09:59.930 --> 10:01.390
<b>What?!</b>

10:02.060 --> 10:03.930
<b>Sanzo?!</b>

10:10.840 --> 10:12.900
<b>What the hell is this thing?!</b>

10:20.680 --> 10:22.910
<b>Where am I?</b>

10:23.720 --> 10:27.420
<b>I see you're awake,
Priest Genjo Sanzo.</b>

10:27.420 --> 10:29.960
<b>So you didn't die?</b>

10:29.960 --> 10:33.530
<b>Unfortunately, my physical body
was destroyed.</b>

10:33.530 --> 10:36.400
<b>This place is akin to an entrance
to the world beyond.</b>

10:36.400 --> 10:39.600
<b>Then hurry up and go to the
so-called world beyond.</b>

10:39.600 --> 10:42.940
<b>Oh, no. By the orders of our Lord,</b>

10:42.940 --> 10:47.880
<b>we must deliver your Maten
Scripture to Houtou Castle.</b>

10:47.880 --> 10:50.780
<b>But my physical body is no more,</b>

10:50.780 --> 10:55.980
<b>and I used all my remaining strength
to seal you in this place.</b>

10:55.980 --> 10:58.450
<b>Well, that's too bad for you.</b>

10:58.450 --> 11:02.320
<b>Now, there's no need for you
to render loyal service.</b>

11:02.320 --> 11:04.560
<b>I'm not without means.</b>

11:04.560 --> 11:08.730
<b>If I enter into your mind and
take control of your soul,</b>

11:08.730 --> 11:10.720
<b>you'll act on my every whim.</b>

11:11.330 --> 11:13.970
<b>The Maten Scripture is certain to be
delivered to Houtou Castle</b>

11:13.970 --> 11:16.960
<b>with your very own hands.</b>

11:18.070 --> 11:19.840
<b>Ridiculous!</b>

11:19.840 --> 11:21.670
<b>I dare you to try it.</b>

11:24.380 --> 11:26.350
<b>Sanzo!</b>

11:26.910 --> 11:29.150
<b>Damn it! Can't he hear me?!</b>

11:29.150 --> 11:30.710
<b>Sanzo!</b>

11:33.090 --> 11:36.190
<b>What kind of practical joke is this?</b>

11:36.190 --> 11:38.120
<b>Please don't ask me.</b>

11:38.730 --> 11:40.730
<b>Sanzo!</b>

11:40.730 --> 11:41.530
<b>Hey!</b>

11:41.530 --> 11:43.100
<b>I heard it too!</b>

11:43.100 --> 11:44.830
<b>That was definitely Goku's voice.</b>

11:45.600 --> 11:47.770
<b>What's going on inside?</b>

11:47.770 --> 11:51.260
<b>It'll mean resorting to violence,
but shall we wreck it?</b>

11:51.840 --> 11:53.430
<b>There's probably nothing else
that we CAN do.</b>

11:54.640 --> 11:57.410
<b>I wouldn't have expected less of you,
Priest Genjo Sanzo.</b>

11:57.410 --> 12:00.520
<b>You have a mind made of steel.</b>

12:00.520 --> 12:02.250
<b>But in the end, you're still human.</b>

12:02.250 --> 12:06.550
<b>Your mind is sure to have a weakness
I can take advantage of.</b>

12:06.550 --> 12:09.420
<b>Sorry, but I don't recollect having
any such weakness.</b>

12:10.960 --> 12:12.890
<b>I can't find any now.</b>

12:12.890 --> 12:14.430
<b>But what of your past?</b>

12:14.430 --> 12:18.830
<b>I'm sure to find something, deep at
the bottom of your memories.</b>

12:18.830 --> 12:20.300
<b>I'll strike there.</b>

12:20.970 --> 12:23.870
<b>I shall take my time searching.</b>

12:23.870 --> 12:26.640
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

12:30.550 --> 12:32.010
<b>This is...</b>

12:44.330 --> 12:45.930
<b>Master!</b>

12:45.930 --> 12:47.300
<b>Kouryuu?</b>

12:47.300 --> 12:51.590
<b>Why don't you smoke those where you
won't be found so easily?</b>

12:52.430 --> 12:55.660
<b>Well, the autumn sky was
just so beautiful.</b>

12:56.870 --> 12:59.370
<b>That has nothing to do
with what I asked.</b>

12:59.370 --> 13:02.270
<b>I'm wary of setting fires, so there's
nothing to worry about.</b>

13:03.310 --> 13:06.280
<b>You may as well burn it all
for me while you're at it.</b>

13:06.280 --> 13:07.750
<b>It'll save me the trouble of sweeping.</b>

13:08.950 --> 13:12.110
<b>Kouryuu, the river orphan, is it?</b>

13:13.720 --> 13:16.050
<b>They've certainly given you
a rude nickname.</b>

13:16.890 --> 13:19.690
<b>Well, I won't insist you
befriend such men,</b>

13:19.690 --> 13:21.420
<b>who are monks in name only.</b>

13:22.330 --> 13:24.470
<b>I don't think anything of it.</b>

13:24.470 --> 13:26.190
<b>I'm used to things like that.</b>

13:26.900 --> 13:31.300
<b>Besides, to be honest,
I don't hate this name.</b>

13:32.570 --> 13:37.780
<b>Kouryuu, that word stands for the
great river called the Changjiang.</b>

13:37.780 --> 13:41.440
<b>It's not bad to be likened to its grand
and majestic appearance.</b>

13:42.380 --> 13:45.320
<b>You're the one who's eccentric, Master.</b>

13:45.320 --> 13:49.460
<b>Sure, the Way of the Buddha extols
mercy and preservation of life,</b>

13:49.460 --> 13:52.490
<b>but you not only went to the
trouble of picking me up,</b>

13:52.490 --> 13:56.930
<b>a brat from who knows where, but
you even kept me by your side.</b>

13:56.930 --> 13:59.160
<b>It was because I heard your voice.</b>

14:00.130 --> 14:02.070
<b>You called out to me.</b>

14:03.070 --> 14:04.630
<b>You could say I was designated.</b>

14:05.410 --> 14:08.840
<b>You called out to me persistently,
so many times.</b>

14:08.840 --> 14:11.710
<b>It was a voice that was not a voice,</b>

14:13.150 --> 14:15.180
<b>but it had definitely reached him.</b>

14:15.180 --> 14:18.550
<b>You were so noisy, I just
brought you with me.</b>

14:19.950 --> 14:21.820
<b>What's that supposed to mean?</b>

14:21.820 --> 14:25.430
<b>Someday, you may hear it too.</b>

14:25.430 --> 14:26.890
<b>Someone's voice.</b>

14:27.700 --> 14:29.900
<b>If there is ever someone like that,</b>

14:29.900 --> 14:33.100
<b>I'll find him if it's the last thing I do,</b>

14:33.100 --> 14:35.090
<b>so I can hit him and
tell him to shut up.</b>

14:42.940 --> 14:44.410
<b>I couldn't protect him.</b>

14:53.990 --> 14:57.460
<b>What the heck? This thing's
incredibly tough.</b>

14:57.460 --> 15:00.130
<b>Come to think of it, even when
we fought earlier,</b>

15:00.130 --> 15:02.800
<b>we weren't able to destroy their armor.</b>

15:02.800 --> 15:06.530
<b>No, one of us was able
to banish this armor.</b>

15:10.970 --> 15:12.610
<b>Then that means...</b>

15:12.610 --> 15:15.780
<b>Yup, if the guy in there doesn't
try to get out himself,</b>

15:15.780 --> 15:17.580
<b>there might be nothing we can do.</b>

15:17.580 --> 15:19.840
<b>I suppose we can only wait then.</b>

15:23.820 --> 15:29.520
<b>I see. Burglars broke into Master
Sanzo's room last night,</b>

15:29.520 --> 15:34.400
<b>murdered Master Sanzo, and
stole the Seiten Scripture.</b>

15:34.400 --> 15:37.060
<b>Is this what you're saying?</b>

15:37.060 --> 15:39.330
<b>Yes, it is as you say.</b>

15:39.330 --> 15:43.940
<b>Please grant me permission
to leave the temple.</b>

15:43.940 --> 15:47.310
<b>I shall avenge my master and take
back the Seiten Scripture,</b>

15:47.310 --> 15:49.300
<b>even if it should cost me my life.</b>

15:50.240 --> 15:54.350
<b>Last night, I received a summons
from my master,</b>

15:54.350 --> 15:57.220
<b>and I was bestowed a formal holy
name right before he passed away.</b>

15:58.520 --> 16:02.420
<b>Genjo Sanzo, that's my name
from this day forth!</b>

16:03.820 --> 16:07.020
<b>So that's the will of the Lord Buddha?</b>

16:09.130 --> 16:15.570
<b>I hereby recognize you as Priest
Toua Genjo Sanzo the 31 st,</b>

16:15.570 --> 16:18.770
<b>formal heir to the Seiten
and Maten Scriptures,</b>

16:18.770 --> 16:24.040
<b>two of the five Founding Scriptures
of Heaven and Earth.</b>

16:26.380 --> 16:28.250
<b>You insist on leaving the temple,</b>

16:28.250 --> 16:30.020
<b>but the surrounding mountains</b>

16:30.020 --> 16:33.520
<b>are haunted by all kinds of
evil spirits and monsters.</b>

16:33.520 --> 16:37.980
<b>It'll be too dangerous, even for you,
to go alone and unarmed.</b>

16:40.490 --> 16:42.200
<b>This is?</b>

16:42.200 --> 16:45.390
<b>Take whatever you like
as a parting gift.</b>

16:46.500 --> 16:48.970
<b>It may be that the most terrifying
things in this world</b>

16:48.970 --> 16:51.560
<b>are creatures shaped like men.</b>

16:55.980 --> 16:57.440
<b>This alone will be enough.</b>

16:58.110 --> 16:59.580
<b>All right.</b>

17:00.510 --> 17:02.280
<b>It was a size</b>

17:02.280 --> 17:04.910
<b>that would allow me to shoot through
my temple at any time.</b>

17:07.020 --> 17:08.490
<b>This is it!</b>

17:09.160 --> 17:11.090
<b>Having lost the master
he loved and revered,</b>

17:11.090 --> 17:13.860
<b>Genjo Sanzo descends
the mountain alone!</b>

17:13.860 --> 17:17.400
<b>His soul is beset by uncertainty
and loneliness,</b>

17:17.400 --> 17:19.830
<b>and the overwhelming number
of murders he commits</b>

17:19.830 --> 17:23.360
<b>pushes him closer to losing sight of
the value of his own existence!</b>

17:26.610 --> 17:29.080
<b>Sanzo!</b>

17:29.080 --> 17:32.480
<b>Sanzo! I can't reach him!</b>

17:32.480 --> 17:33.950
<b>No way!</b>

17:36.150 --> 17:37.890
<b>Not again!</b>

17:37.890 --> 17:40.220
<b>Am I not going to be able
to reach out again?!</b>

17:49.560 --> 17:51.530
<b>Hear this, Genjo Sanzo!</b>

17:51.530 --> 17:56.600
<b>You serve the priesthood, and yet,
your hands are covered with blood!</b>

17:56.600 --> 17:59.440
<b>Do you not feel any guilt
in your heart?!</b>

17:59.440 --> 18:01.780
<b>When you look at your hands
stained by the dark blood,</b>

18:01.780 --> 18:03.440
<b>do you think nothing of it?!</b>

18:26.500 --> 18:28.370
<b>I can hear a voice.</b>

18:28.370 --> 18:29.840
<b>What?!</b>

18:36.610 --> 18:38.980
<b>Do you have anything else left to say?</b>

18:39.910 --> 18:42.680
<b>No matter how red my hands become,</b>

18:42.680 --> 18:44.170
<b>blood can be washed away!</b>

18:50.690 --> 18:54.180
<b>That's how we have lived.</b>

19:06.070 --> 19:07.210
<b>Sanzo!</b>

19:07.210 --> 19:08.670
<b>Goku!</b>

19:09.610 --> 19:11.350
<b>You're safe!</b>

19:11.350 --> 19:13.910
<b>I had to put up with some
stupid nonsense.</b>

19:13.910 --> 19:16.620
<b>What the heck were you guys
doing inside?</b>

19:16.620 --> 19:18.080
<b>A voice...</b>

19:19.190 --> 19:20.710
<b>I heard a voice.</b>

19:21.760 --> 19:24.960
<b>Someday, you may hear it too.</b>

19:24.960 --> 19:26.390
<b>Someone's voice.</b>

19:27.260 --> 19:29.320
<b>What is it, Sanzo?</b>

19:31.930 --> 19:34.700
<b>Really, you're just so noisy that
I can't win against you.</b>

19:37.240 --> 19:39.070
<b>Blood can be washed away,</b>

19:39.070 --> 19:42.410
<b>but in turn, people shed blood
in order to live.</b>

19:42.410 --> 19:44.710
<b>In the end, you're probably
just deluding yourself</b>

19:44.710 --> 19:46.780
<b>if you think you can live
by such ideals.</b>

19:46.780 --> 19:52.390
<b>Jiroushin, do you know why we,
the gods, exist in the Heavens?</b>

19:52.390 --> 19:53.220
<b>Lady?</b>

19:53.220 --> 19:55.190
<b>It's not to look down on them,</b>

19:55.190 --> 19:56.850
<b>but to watch over them.</b>

19:57.930 --> 20:00.120
<b>To watch over those who
were born to live!</b>

20:10.500 --> 20:12.840
<b>Are you fine with how things
are right now?</b>

20:12.840 --> 20:16.680
<b>I just told you, didn't I? We're only
here to watch over them.</b>

20:16.680 --> 20:19.010
<b>We couldn't possibly stop them.</b>

20:19.710 --> 20:21.180
<b>Isn't that right, Nataku?</b>

20:22.620 --> 20:26.780
<b>But Sanzo and his gang sure
have no end of troubles!</b>

20:27.820 --> 20:29.490
<b>Just keep on going.</b>

20:29.490 --> 20:33.130
<b>No matter what may await
you along your way.</b>

20:33.130 --> 20:35.960
<b>Even if what awaits you is a road
made of corpses.</b>

20:38.930 --> 20:45.340
<b>Sou hito ga yosasou na
kao de yatte kuru</b>

20:45.340 --> 20:50.710
<b>Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku</b>

20:50.710 --> 20:56.220
<b>Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de</b>

20:56.220 --> 20:59.620
<b>Ue o miagerunda</b>

20:59.620 --> 21:05.430
<b>Donna arifureta shiin mo enji-tsuzukeru</b>

21:05.430 --> 21:10.830
<b>Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa</b>

21:10.830 --> 21:16.170
<b>Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou</b>

21:16.170 --> 21:20.110
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:27.080 --> 21:30.750
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:30.750 --> 21:32.720
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:32.720 --> 21:36.820
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:36.820 --> 21:40.960
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:40.960 --> 21:43.630
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:43.630 --> 21:48.700
<b>Haritsumeta puresshaa tonariawase de</b>

21:48.700 --> 21:54.110
<b>Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau</b>

21:54.110 --> 21:59.510
<b>Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou</b>

21:59.510 --> 22:03.570
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
